# Ouse.Godonia package version

The custom Godot editor is **not published**. Games restore `Ouse.Godonia` from the editor-local nupkg folder, not nuget.org.

- Keep `Directory.Build.props` `<Version>` and template `PackageVersion Include="Ouse.Godonia"` at **1.0.0**.
- Updating the editor (C++ / GodotTools / runtime deploy) must **not** bump this version.
- Overwriting the local `Ouse.Godonia.1.0.0.nupkg` during deploy is fine.
- Only change the version when the user explicitly asks to publish or bump the package.
